WEBVTT

00:04:26.076 --> 00:04:30.316
Our a solution to this fragmentation

00:04:30.356 --> 00:04:32.676
was this document:

00:04:32.676 --> 00:04:35.516
the Oslo Climate Budget,

00:04:36.036 --> 00:04:40.076
which we put forward
for the first time in 2016.

00:04:40.116 --> 00:04:42.996
The first climate budget,
as far as we know.

00:04:43.356 --> 00:04:45.956
A climate budget is a governance tool.

00:04:45.956 --> 00:04:50.956
It structures and organizes how we can get
from climate target policies and words

00:04:50.956 --> 00:04:53.116
to action and results.

00:04:53.436 --> 00:04:58.396
It also makes all parts
of the administration in Oslo

00:04:58.436 --> 00:05:00.756
a stakeholder to the climate goals.